Package: arma.panel.ife
Type: Package
Title: ARMA Dynamics in Panel Models with Interactive Effects
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: c(
    person("Pablo", "Mones", email = "pm3257@columbia.edu", role = c("aut", "cre")),
    person("Jushan", "Bai", role = "aut"),
    person("Yiqun", "Chen", role = "ctb"))
Description: The package implements methods described in Bai and Mones (2026), 'Likelihood 
and Order Selection for ARMA Dynamics in Panel Models with Interactive Effects'. We provide
function for point estimation, inference and model selection for short dynamic panels with 
ARMA dynamics and interactive effects. Estimation is conducted via gaussian quasi-maximum 
likelihood and second-moment generalizedmethod of moments and supports strictly exogenous 
regressors. Model selection uses a penalized criterion to select the autoregressive (p) moving 
average (q) orders and number of interactive effects (r).
